OL,3,GNEWSAPreparations under way as Storm
OL,4,AAusten approaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreparations are under way in Jersey
OL,7,Fahead of predicted very strong winds
OL,8,Fbrought by Storm Austen.
OL,10,FJersey Met has forecast winds reaching
OL,11,Fsevere gale force nine, with gusts of
OL,12,Fup to 80mph (129km/h) set to hit the
OL,13,Fisland from Thursday evening and
OL,14,Fovernight into Friday.
OL,16,FAll Government of Jersey schools will
OL,17,Fclose on Friday and islanders were
OL,18,Fadvised to avoid outdoor activity where
OL,19,Fpossible, said officials.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
